# The quest panel with a long quest (CIPlay quest_panel, in a test world 'CI ...'): The Frontier's 32 steps, five done -
# the panel shows five steps at a time (the step done before the current one, it and the next three), the rest scrolls.
# Then CIShot quest_panel for the picture (the panel shows while the player is at the island: "keep" leaves it there).
island The Frontier keep
wait 5
zone harbour
read Welcome board
open Harbour office locker
zone square
read Smith's note
expect step 5
at 28 86
wait 2
